### One plan per tracker. Replace the full plan with PUT; no plan is seeded automatically.
### Requires a bearer token. Only the tracker owner can edit the plan.
PUT {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tréninkový checklist",
  "weekLabel": "Aktuální plán",
  "days": [
    {
      "id": "monday",
      "label": "Po",
      "name": "Push",
      "focus": "Hrudník, ramena, triceps",
      "exercises": [
        {"id": "pushups", "name": "Kliky", "sets": "2 × 6–12", "description": "Klasické nebo s vyvýšenou oporou"},
        {"id": "plank", "name": "Plank", "sets": "2 × 20–40 s"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Returns the plan with a completed boolean on each exercise. Owner and members may read it.
GET {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Owner and members may set or unset a completion.
PUT {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}/days/monday/exercises/pushups/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completed": true}

### Reset all completions. There is no automatic weekly reset or history.
DELETE {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}/completion
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Day IDs must be unique in the plan; exercise IDs must be unique within their day.
### IDs use lowercase letters, digits, underscores or hyphens and begin with a letter or digit.
### A plan replacement preserves completion for unchanged day/exercise ID pairs.
### Removing or changing an ID deletes its completion. Order follows the input arrays.
### Unchanged IDs also preserve images. Delete an exercise's image before removing its exercise or day.

### Upload one image to a saved exercise (owner only). Delete an existing image before replacing it.
### Supported: JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, GIF, AVIF; max 10 MB.
POST {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}/days/monday/exercises/pushups/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=workout-image

--workout-image
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./example.png
--workout-image--

### Remove the stored image (owner only).
DELETE {{host}}/api/workout/{{tracker_id}}/days/monday/exercises/pushups/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
